# PROJECT DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# DPMIS LITE – Research Project Management Information System

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a fully functional, simplified web-based Research Project Management Information System inspired by the workflow and general purpose of the Department of Science and Technology's DPMIS V2 (https://dpmisv2.dost.gov.ph/).

The project will be called **DPMIS Lite**.

IMPORTANT: This is an independent prototype inspired by DPMIS. Do not make an exact copy of the original website. Do not use DOST logos, proprietary assets, or imply that this application is an official government system.

The purpose is to demonstrate how a research funding management system works, from researcher registration and proposal submission to administrative evaluation, approval, project implementation, monitoring, and completion.

The application must be a WORKING WEB APPLICATION, not a static UI prototype.

Users must be able to register, log in, submit proposals, upload documents, process applications, change statuses, evaluate proposals, manage projects, and view dashboards using persistent Firebase data.

Prioritize a simple, understandable, maintainable architecture over unnecessary complexity.

