14. Log out.
15. Log in as the evaluator.
16. Review the proposal and submit an evaluation.
17. Log out.
18. Log in as the administrator.
19. Review the evaluation and approve the proposal.
20. Verify that a project record is created.
21. Log in as a project officer.
22. Open the approved project.
23. Submit or review a progress report.
